// Lucas County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-10
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Pages that block automated fetching (ProMedica and its four
// Lucas County hospitals, the Board of Elections and the Toledo Humane Society)
// were checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The Auditor's property search (icare.co.lucas.oh.us) runs on Tyler iasWorld
//     Public Access; July's label belonged to Logan County.
//   * TMACOG is now the Lake Erie West Regional Council; 911 is at
//     911lucascountyoh.gov; the mental health board is at lcmentallywell.com.
//   * The Toledo Area Humane Society is now the Toledo Humane Society
//     (toledohumane.org).
//   * Unison Health operates under Neighborhood Health Association; A Renewed Mind
//     merged into OhioGuidestone.
//   * The community foundation is the Greater Toledo Community Foundation; the
//     Toledo Symphony and Ballet appear as Live Arts Toledo.
//   * The Blade has said it will close if no buyer is found by Dec 31, 2026; recheck
//     in January.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Lucas County IA; Toledo Spain/OR/WA/IA; Oregon (the state); Sylvania GA/AL;
//   Holland MI; Waterville ME; the "Village of Swanton" on the county list is Fulton
//   County (Swanton Township is listed); Owens Community College, Penta, Perrysburg
//   and Rossford are Wood County; gesutoledo.com now redirects to an unrelated site.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Cities: Toledo (the seat), Maumee, Oregon, Sylvania and Waterville. Villages
//     with sites: Holland, Ottawa Hills and Whitehouse; Berkey and Harbor View have
//     none.
//   * Eight school districts, the ESC of Lake Erie West, the University of Toledo and
//     Mercy College of Ohio. No career center is based in the county.
//   * ProMedica and Mercy Health hospitals; Neighborhood Health Association (FQHC).
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * Lourdes University (closing after 2025-26, in Chapter 11), Gesu School
//     (hijacked domain), WNWO (no local news since 2023), Collins Park Golf Course
//     (closed for 2026) and private entertainment businesses.
//   * Toledo City Council, township fire departments and some arts groups were not
//     fully researched.

